Third-party notices

The licence above covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the
software this pipeline installs, the data it downloads, or the model
parameters it loads, each of which carries its own terms. The full list, with
the identifier every source is pinned to, is config/sources.tsv, and the
versions and licences resolved at install time are recorded in
results/environment/tool_licences.tsv and results/environment/versions.tsv.
The notices that require repeating are repeated here.

Ramachandran reference distributions, in data/reference_data/rotarama, are the
rotarama_data set from the Richardson laboratory and its contributors,
distributed under CC-BY-4.0. They are downloaded rather than copied into this
repository, and the licence file served alongside them is downloaded with
them. Attribution to the Richardson laboratory and contributors is required by
that licence and is given here.

US-align is redistributed under a permissive custom notice rather than a
standard licence. The notice is in the file the binary ships with and is not
reproduced or altered here.

AlphaFold2 parameters are not covered by the MIT licence of the ColabFold code
that loads them. Their terms are attribution-only as stated by the model's
repository, and the licence file served with the archive is recorded at fetch
time in results/environment/alphafold_params_LICENSE.txt.

OpenStructure is LGPL-3.0-or-later and ColabFold's prebuilt search binaries are
GPL-3.0-or-later. Both are installed into separate conda environments and
called as programs. No code from either is copied into this repository and
nothing here is a derivative work of them.

Structure and ligand data come from the RCSB Protein Data Bank under CC0-1.0.
The alignment server at api.colabfold.com is used under its own terms of
service, which the README describes.
